  1+  B545              ; ============================================================================
  2+  B545              ; UFO direct-delta mover - high RAM B545h
  3+  B545              ;
  4+  B545              ; IY = old UFO left-half VRAM base
  5+  B545              ; IX = new UFO left-half VRAM base
  6+  B545              ;
  7+  B545              ; UFO movement is +/-2 X coordinate units = +/-1 VRAM byte.
  8+  B545              ; A 17-byte XOR delta changes each complete 16-byte UFO row directly from
  9+  B545              ; OLD position to NEW position. There is no erase-then-draw blank interval.
 10+  B545              ; ============================================================================
 11+  B545
 12+  B545              UFO_SEAM_HIGH:
 13+  B545 F5                   PUSH    AF
